            "components": {
              "reconstruct/description_resource_trace/is_lossless_description/redundant_positions": "CompressionDescription preserves exact guards, ordered dictionary/token traces, all resource fields, empty-block/empty-string behavior, missing/duplicate keys and original short-circuit error order. Native lossless iff, source-cell provenance, projected redundancy exactness/count and token-successor proofs. Prior8600 source-expression cases pass.",
              "prefix_free and unique parsing": "CompressionPrefix retains original nonempty family/nonempty words/unique words/strict-prefix predicate and pairwise traversal. prefixFreeMeaning/prefixMeaning identify exact conditions. commonInitial/firstWordUnique/uniqueParse establish arbitrary finite sequence unique parsing. Explicit token list boundaries are retained by original reconstruction; no additional parser guard.",
