              "universal_shortening_impossible": "shortCountBound/shorteningBoundary/admittedShorteningResult establish the original strict raw-list cardinality predicate at every accepted width. noDistinctShortAssignment proves no pairwise-distinct assignment over generated occurrences. noInjectiveShortCode proves the set-injective theorem for distinct labels. CompressionCanonical.inheritedNoInjectiveShortCode derives that condition from the registered Information Quantity complete_word_support admission, whose distinct-label guard is present in pinned V3. No new scientific or executable guard is added. The accepted duplicate-label raw helper is not misrepresented as satisfying the stronger set-injective theorem; TURN_145_DuplicateLabels.lean explicitly verifies the boundary.",
