              "SPEC.dimensions/witnesses/controls": "Complete original1024 ten-axis product, exact order/IDs/forms/reasons, exhaustive enumeration, unique survivor and coordinate rejection. All five actual source operational witnesses passed kernel proof. Original laws, induction, exclusions and four controls retained. Optimization remains the registered completed dependency; no new scoring or tie selection is introduced.",
